# RateHawk / ETG B2B v3 — server-side only.
# Real values must live in the deployment secret store, not in this file.
# RATEHAWK_KEY_ID       = Basic-auth username / ETG key id.
# RATEHAWK_API_TOKEN    = Basic-auth password / ETG API token. Also verifies ETG webhooks.
# RATEHAWK_ENVIRONMENT  = sandbox or production.
# RATEHAWK_BASE_URL     = optional host override; normally leave empty.
# RATEHAWK_B2B_EMAIL    = fixed Amazingfly corporate/manager email used as user.email for deposit bookings.
# RATEHAWK_BOOKING_TIMEOUT_MS = optional negotiated booking cut-off; default is 120000 ms.
RATEHAWK_KEY_ID=""
RATEHAWK_API_TOKEN=""
RATEHAWK_ENVIRONMENT="sandbox"
RATEHAWK_BASE_URL=""
